// The overlay of the framework: the statistics column of stats.flecs and the
// terminal of the in game console, which share the language of theme.flecs.
// box.monitor loads this script at import. The terminal exists while the
// world has a Console singleton; box.ui fills it and shows it while the
// console is open. An application that wants another overlay ships its own
// etc/ui/overlay/overlay.flecs.
include stats
include terminal
using box.ui
using box.ui.terminal

if Console?[Console] {
  TerminalPanel console
}
